#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:9
#: 98437b6c86074f4ba79d3b17abb65d87
msgid ""
"The APM2.x is end of life for use with ArduPilot. This article is made "
"available for existing users."
msgstr "APM2.x 已停止与 ArduPilot 配合使用。本文仅供现有用户参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:13
#: 85ff51f8d74b46d38238fa417dfb44fc
msgid "APM 2.5"
msgstr "APM 2.5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:17
#: 2ca3957070cd42219cfb1458c8c4c23c
msgid ""
"The APM 2.5 board requires no assembly, and is ready for firmware. You have "
"a choice of side or top entry pin configuration, in order to accommodate a "
"variety of installations. You'll see this option when you order."
msgstr "APM 2.5 板无需组装，可直接烧录固件。您可以选择侧入式或顶入式引脚配置，以适应各种安装方式。订购时会提供此选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:25
#: d6337ec86f4449c2b797520dbbf50e10
msgid ""
"This page gives you a look under the hood, and goes into more detail about "
"the design of this board."
msgstr "本页让您深入了解飞控内部，并详细介绍该板的设计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:28
#: 4bb4f668c8f64100ba3925ecf2755a33
msgid ""
"The APM 2.5 has some improvements over the APM 2.0, but they both have a "
"very similar layout and function."
msgstr "APM 2.5 对 APM 2.0 有所改进，但两者的布局和功能非常相似。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:32
#: 5d1b96339c264cde9d6e4c3d05e9e652
msgid "APM 2.6"
msgstr "APM 2.6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:34
#: 1936403a921149409bee9b7372ed34b8
msgid ""
"**APM 2.6** is a revision of the APM that makes use of an external compass."
msgstr "**APM 2.6** 是 APM 的修订版，使用外置罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:36
#: d3231e4176f64060adb93d980f621cae
msgid ""
"The APM 2.6 has no on board compass, and is optimized for vehicles where the"
" compass should be placed as far from power and motor sources as possible to"
" avoid magnetic interference."
msgstr "APM 2.6 没有板载罗盘，专为需要将罗盘尽量远离电源和电机噪声源以避免磁干扰的飞行器而优化设计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:39
#: d858233a49824e679ae83f2ea856c7f6
msgid ""
"APM 2.6 is designed to be used with the 3DR GPS uBlox LEA-6 with Compass "
"module."
msgstr "APM 2.6 设计与 3DR GPS uBlox LEA-6 带罗盘模块配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:41
#: 3fd7d17b980049979bf6284aeb09d792
msgid ""
"The GPS/Compass module may be mounted further from noise sources than the "
"APM itself."
msgstr "GPS/罗盘模块可以安装在比 APM 本身更远离噪声源的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:43
#: 76e09ce320954c8ebc30c495d38062f0
msgid ""
"APM 2.6 requires a GPS unit with an on board compass for full autonomy."
msgstr "APM 2.6 需要带板载罗盘的 GPS 单元才能实现完全自主飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:45
#: 15d4332bac36461f9ed03c86bd2dcf4d
msgid ""
"For information on installing a 3DR GPS uBlox LEA-6 with Compass, visit "
":ref:`3DR Power Module <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>`."
msgstr ""
"有关安装 3DR GPS uBlox LEA-6 带罗盘的信息，请访问 :ref:`3DR 电源模块 <common-installing-3dr-"
"ublox-gps-compass-module>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:52
#: d9c3cab76f2c48de9904e024c964abbe
msgid "Using the APM 2.5/2.6 Enclosure"
msgstr "使用 APM 2.5/2.6 外壳"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:54
#: 6631de4a0aa54170939bd7d4bb5450c8
msgid ""
"The APM 2.5/2.6 board is shipped in an enclosure with foam protecting the "
"barometric pressure sensor, as shown here."
msgstr "APM 2.5/2.6 板随外壳一起出货，外壳中有泡沫保护气压传感器，如图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:61
#: 017cf177edaa46a897bb7038630c6a0e
msgid "Not using the APM Enclosure"
msgstr "不使用 APM 外壳"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:63
#: d176fa5b44be46d4b978dfda86877e25
msgid ""
"If you aren't using the enclosure, make sure to cover the barometric sensor "
"with some open cell foam, cotton padding or tissue to protect it from prop "
"wash, wind and turbulence. Also, the barometric sensor is sensitive to light"
" and readings can change by several meters from direct sunlight to shade. "
"Some type of light shield (on top of the foam) will minimize the effects of "
"light changes."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用外壳，请确保用开孔泡沫、棉垫或纸巾覆盖气压传感器，以防螺旋桨气流、风和湍流的影响。此外，气压传感器对光线敏感，从直射阳光到阴影处读数可能变化数米。某种遮光罩（放在泡沫上方）可将光线变化的影响降到最低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:78
#: ca051528525e4cf788eaf52c6879331f
msgid ""
"The most common way to power the APM2 is to use the :ref:`3DR Power Module "
"<common-3dr-power-module>`."
msgstr "为 APM2 供电最常见的方式是使用 :ref:`3DR 电源模块 <common-3dr-power-module>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:80
#: 5da78c53f93a4fa481d415d0686de63b
msgid ""
"Detailed information on powering the APM and providing power to Servos is "
"provided in :ref:`Powering the APM2 <common-powering-the-apm2>`."
msgstr ":ref:`APM2 供电 <common-powering-the-apm2>` 中提供了为 APM 供电以及向舵机供电的详细信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:86
#: c503e898b31b4f489f127f58f7f53ed8
msgid "Explanation of solder jumper options on the bottom of the board"
msgstr "板底面焊桥选项说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:92
#: fe3680a2acb14c2f9f693d9b44cb566a
msgid "Changing your telemetry to use UART2 (aka Serial3)"
msgstr "将数传更改为使用 UART2（即 Serial3）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:94
#: ec2561f48cc54c9ca0e53198890ee222
msgid ""
"By default an Xbee connected to the APM2 will use UART0 (aka \"Serial\" in "
"Arduino) which is shared with the USB as mentioned above. If you wish to "
"instead use UART2 (aka \"Serial3\") for telemetry you can change the "
"\"AutoMUX UART0\" jumper on the bottom of the APM2."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，连接到 APM2 的 Xbee 将使用 UART0（Arduino 中的「Serial」），如上所述与 USB 共用。如果希望改用 "
"UART2（「Serial3」）进行数传，可以更改 APM2 底部的「AutoMUX UART0」焊桥。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:99
#: 220111f6078846579b9b8db7cd7f3504
msgid ""
"Although difficult to see, by default there are two small jumpers between "
"the upper pads that must be cut with an X-Acto blade. Then a new solder "
"bridge must be made to join the bottom pads."
msgstr "虽然难以看清，但默认情况下，上方焊盘之间有两个小焊桥，必须用美工刀割断。然后需要新建焊桥连接下方焊盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:107
#: deddd53c00e64e8b9498176e7bb60ef8
msgid "APM 2.5 Board Features"
msgstr "APM 2.5 板功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm25-and-26-overview.rst:113
#: 5f3b79b81a8546a9a6b8e1a92cce24f6
msgid "APM 2.5 Board Assembly Options"
msgstr "APM 2.5 板组装选项"

